WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.873
Bang! Bang!

2
00:00:11.874 --> 00:00:15.846
One stormy night a wizard knocked on the door.

3
00:00:15.847 --> 00:00:17.973
The wizard was wet.

4
00:00:17.974 --> 00:00:28.851
"Please give me shelter from this rain!"

5
00:00:28.852 --> 00:00:32.640
Tom was in the Throne Room.

6
00:00:32.641 --> 00:00:44.917
Guards brought in the wizard.

7
00:00:44.918 --> 00:00:47.440
"I’m Daimon the wizard.

8
00:00:47.441 --> 00:00:52.614
May I stay here until the rain stops?" he asked.

9
00:00:52.615 --> 00:00:55.982
"Of course!" the king said.

10
00:00:55.983 --> 00:01:00.666
"Warm yourself by the fire, Daimon."

11
00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:04.132
"I will get you a drink," Tom said.

12
00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:07.167
He waved his wand. "Water!"

13
00:01:07.168 --> 00:01:10.545
Poof! A tub of water appeared.

14
00:01:10.546 --> 00:01:14.470
"Oops!" Tom said.

15
00:01:14.471 --> 00:01:18.514
Daimon laughed.

16
00:01:18.515 --> 00:01:22.225
"I don't like water anyway," he said.

17
00:01:22.226 --> 00:01:29.276
"I'd like a hot drink."

18
00:01:29.277 --> 00:01:34.061
Daimon dried off by the fire.

19
00:01:34.062 --> 00:01:38.006
"What a beautiful castle!" he said.

20
00:01:38.007 --> 00:01:40.010
The king smiled.

21
00:01:40.011 --> 00:01:48.408
"I will show you around."

22
00:01:48.409 --> 00:01:52.950
He led Daimon out of the Throne Room.

23
00:01:52.951 --> 00:01:56.709
Tom sighed.

24
00:01:56.710 --> 00:02:00.840
"I bet Daimon never messes up his spells."

25
00:02:00.841 --> 00:02:02.830
Cat frowned.

26
00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:05.761
"I don't trust that wizard."

27
00:02:05.762 --> 00:02:15.796
"I'm going to follow them."

28
00:02:15.797 --> 00:02:19.596
The king was showing Daimon the Grim Dungeon.

29
00:02:19.597 --> 00:02:24.095
The dungeon was dark and damp.

30
00:02:24.096 --> 00:02:29.322
The ceiling dripped.

31
00:02:29.323 --> 00:02:34.466
"No one ever escapes from here!" the king boasted.

32
00:02:34.467 --> 00:02:41.061
Suddenly Daimon flicked his wand. Poof!

33
00:02:41.062 --> 00:02:44.213
The king was trapped inside the dungeon!

34
00:02:44.214 --> 00:02:51.253
Daimon laughed.

35
00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:54.643
"Now you can't escape either.

36
00:02:54.644 --> 00:03:05.928
And I am taking over this castle!"

